WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.700
If there is tape —

2
00:00:02.748 --> 00:00:05.980
keep the area dry until three days after surgery,

3
00:00:06.020 --> 00:00:07.660
and do not clean it before then.

4
00:00:07.953 --> 00:00:09.820
If there is no tape —

5
00:00:09.873 --> 00:00:13.180
clean the edges gently twice a day with equal parts

6
00:00:13.242 --> 00:00:16.300
hydrogen peroxide and distilled water,

7
00:00:16.348 --> 00:00:18.380
then apply an antibiotic ointment

8
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:19.900
such as bacitracin.
